# Passthrough — single pass copying the scene color to the swapchain.
# This is the simplest possible .pipeline file and serves as a working
# reference for effect authors.
#
# Format:
#   RESOURCE <name> <format> <scale>   (intermediate render target)
#   PASS <shader> <target>             (pass target; shader = <basename>.frag.spv)
#   SAMPLER <binding> <source>         (sampler binding for the previous PASS)
#
# Built-in source names:
#   SCENE_COLOR    — the scene's offscreen color buffer
#   SCENE_DEPTH    — the scene's offscreen depth buffer
#   SCENE_EMISSIVE — emissive attachment (Phase B — falls back to SCENE_COLOR)
# Built-in target names:
#   SWAPCHAIN — the final presented image

PASS passthrough SWAPCHAIN
  SAMPLER 0 SCENE_COLOR
